      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAYLIGHT (8) is yet to be beaten at the course and distance, scoring three wins from as many starts. Recorded a 2.5 lengths win (18.06) in a NG last time at Richmond. Expected to be in the finish. STAR ZIPPER (6) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (21.99) at this track in a NG over 388m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Deserves serious consideration again. LAURIE'S FERRARI (1) was below best at his last start when 6th at The Gardens following a win (22.75) there two back. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from four starts. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Should be about the money. REBORN SPARK (2) boasts a solid strike-rate from this box.",
